; A commodity priced in two commodities is fetched in terms of the
; commodity of its latest own price at or before now ($ here).  The
; future-dated EUR price must not count, and EUR, which has no price of
; its own, must not be fetched "in terms of AAPL" (the inverted link),
; which also used to drop AAPL from the batch.

